The NodeDex system design — including the identity model, sigil
generation algorithm, patina scoring model, trait engine rules,
constellation graph schema, and trust score specification — is
published under the Apache License, Version 2.0. This grants any
implementor the right to build independent, compatible identity
systems without open-sourcing their own code.

