RATIONALE
The NodeDex Dart implementation imports from lib/core/, lib/providers/,
and lib/services/protocol/sip/ (all GPL-3.0-or-later). Under GPL
section 5, any work that incorporates GPL code must itself be
distributed under the GPL. The Apache-2.0 grant above covers only the
system design — it does not override the GPL terms that apply to this
compiled Dart implementation.

In plain terms:
  - You MAY design and implement a NodeDex-compatible identity system
    in your own project under Apache-2.0.
  - You MAY NOT copy, fork, or redistribute the Dart files in this
    directory under a non-GPL license.

MESHTASTIC DEPENDENCY NOTE
NodeDex entries are keyed on Meshtastic node IDs. The Meshtastic
protobuf integration (lib/generated/meshtastic/) is GPL-3.0-only
per upstream (https://github.com/meshtastic/protobufs). This creates
a GPL-3.0-only floor for any combined binary that includes both layers.
